## Weight by sand type

| Sand type | Lbs per cu yd | Tons per cu yd |
|-----------|--------------|----------------|
| All-purpose / fill | 2,700 lbs | **1.35 tons** |
| Paver / leveling | 2,700 lbs | **1.35 tons** |
| Play sand | 2,600 lbs | **1.30 tons** |
| Mason sand | 2,600 lbs | **1.30 tons** |

*Source: Landscape supply industry standards. Dry weight. Saturated sand can weigh significantly more.*

## Weight by volume

| Volume | All-purpose sand | Play sand |
|--------|-----------------|-----------|
| 0.5 cu yd | 1,350 lbs | 1,300 lbs |
| 1.0 cu yd | 2,700 lbs | 2,600 lbs |
| 2.0 cu yd | 5,400 lbs | 5,200 lbs |

## 50-lb bag reference

| Bags (50 lb) | Volume | Weight |
|--------------|--------|--------|
| 10 bags | 0.19 cu yd | 500 lbs |
| 27 bags | 0.50 cu yd | 1,350 lbs |
| 54 bags | 1.00 cu yd | 2,700 lbs |

## Coverage per 50-lb bag

| Depth | Coverage per bag |
|-------|-----------------|
| 1 inch | 6 sq ft |
| 2 inches | 3 sq ft |
| 4 inches | 1.5 sq ft |

Use the [Sand Calculator](/calculator/sand) to get exact tons and bag counts for your paver base, sandbox, or fill project.

